---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Disclaimer | CivicConnect" description="Read the legal disclaimer for CivicConnect.">
  <div class="container section max-w-3xl">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="mb-12">
      <span class="badge badge-soft mb-3" data-tone="warning">Legal Notice</span>
      <h1 class="text-h1 mb-4">
        Official Disclaimer. <span class="text-muted-foreground">Please read before using.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-body text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
        Important boundaries regarding the informational nature of CivicConnect.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="space-y-8 text-small leading-relaxed">
      
      <div class="card !p-6 border-warning/30 bg-warning/5 space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-h3 text-lg font-medium text-foreground">1. No Professional Legal Counsel</h2>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground">
          CivicConnect is an informational portal designed to help citizens locate government resources and understand general legal rules. <strong>It does not provide legal representation or legal advice.</strong> No attorney-client relationship is formed by using the AI assistant or reading these pages.
        </p>
      </div>

      <article class="card space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-h3 text-lg font-medium text-foreground">2. Accuracy and Completeness</h2>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground">
          While CivicConnect takes steps to retrieve official files and constrain summaries to actual government text, we cannot guarantee that every detail is complete, accurate, or fully up to date. Government regulations, scheme parameters, income ceilings, and document checklists change frequently.
        </p>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground">
          Users are advised to treat all outputs as summaries to be cross-checked against original government publications.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="card space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-h3 text-lg font-medium text-foreground">3. Affiliation and Authority</h2>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground">
          CivicConnect is an independent civic technology initiative. <strong>It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or representing any government entity</strong>, including the Government of India, state governments, or municipal corporations.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="card space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-h3 text-lg font-medium text-foreground">4. Liability Limitation</h2>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground">
          Under no circumstances shall the creators, developers, or partners of CivicConnect be liable for any direct or indirect damage or loss resulting from:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-muted-foreground">
          <li>Decisions made or actions taken in reliance on AI-generated summaries.</li>
          <li>Unavailability of government benefit schemes or change of eligibility rules.</li>
          <li>Filing delays or missed legal deadlines.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="card space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-h3 text-lg font-medium text-foreground">5. Direct Verification</h2>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground">
          We encourage users to click the source links provided in our citation drawers to inspect the original gazette or policy document, or visit an empaneled official or certified advocate for formal legal advice.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
